      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. but it feels like the 'critics' side is mostly just about fear of change or trying to protect the status quo, whereas the pro-voucher side is about actual student success. do you think the arguments against it are actually as strong as the ones for it, or is it mostly just political pushback?",
